'A'QNO 'A'uNO 'A'iNO 'A'nNO 'A'eNO ...

VKHBB 'A'A'A 01NL'ADBV 0001

(clone the strings to var1 and var2)
VLNOOC VNLO'ADB LOO'ACVN'ADB

V'ANLOONG V51NLOW       (if var2 is empty jump +81 out of the loop)
(append `AAA?NO` to var1)
VBBNONNKH VNLN 'A'ANO 'A'ANO 'A'ANO 'AN'ADBMJNO 'A'NNO 'A'ON CVNB'ADB
ONNC VNOB'ADB           (pop a value from var2)
Va0NLVBW                (jump back -96 to the start of the loop)
VBB

LNOONC VNLN'ADB

VLNBOBOBOO'AC VNL'ADBO80NFff (set up head in var1 and counter in var2)

VNLN'A'ANO 'A'ANC VNB'ADB    (add two nodes)
O08NLMBNEW                   (if var2 is zero jump +8 out of the loop)
Vd7NLVBW                     (jump back -41 to the start of the loop)

VNOOOOO'A N'A'A N0000'A      (create a root node for the encoding tree)

VU
